{
  "candidateCarrier": {
    "default": "existing-component",
    "operations": {
      "candidate": "generated-component",
      "catalog": "existing-component",
      "existing": "existing-component"
    }
  },
  "conditions": [
    {
      "destination": "create",
      "message": "组件插入使用 create；Flow 正文必须提供当前工程或前序导入的真实图片 staticFallbackAssetId。",
      "parents": [
        "owner",
        "flow-body"
      ],
      "requiredForParent": {
        "field": "staticFallbackAssetId",
        "parent": "flow-body"
      }
    }
  ],
  "description": "插入已有、目录或候选组件。Flow正文使用create parent:flow-body，并且必须提供当前工程真实图片assetId作为staticFallbackAssetId；该字段在Slide等其他载体可省略，不能将输入Schema的optional理解为Flow可省略。优先复用已有组件包与可用后备素材，正文组件自然占位并随内容宽度排版。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 packageId 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"existing\",\"packageId\":values[\"packageId\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"component.insert\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "existing"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 sourceId/packageId/version/sha256 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"catalog\",\"sourceId\":values[\"sourceId\"],\"packageId\":values[\"packageId\"],\"version\":values[\"version\"],\"sha256\":values[\"sha256\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"component.insert\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "catalog"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 files/staticFallbackAssetId 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"candidate\",\"files\":values[\"files\"],\"staticFallbackAssetId\":values[\"staticFallbackAssetId\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"component.insert\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "candidate"
    }
  ],
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "oneOf": [
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "const": "existing",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "packageId": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "staticFallbackAssetId": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation",
          "packageId"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operation": {
            "const": "catalog",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "packageId": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sha256": {
            "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sourceId": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "staticFallbackAssetId": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "version": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation",
          "sourceId",
          "packageId",
          "version",
          "sha256"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "files": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "maxLength": 24000000,
                  "pattern": "^(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{4})*(?:[A-Za-z0-9+/]{2}==|[A-Za-z0-9+/]{3}=)?$",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "encoding": {
                      "const": "utf8",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "text": {
                      "maxLength": 18000000,
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "encoding",
                    "text"
                  ],
                  "type": "object"
                }
              ]
            },
            "propertyNames": {
              "maxLength": 500,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "operation": {
            "const": "candidate",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "staticFallbackAssetId": {
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operation",
          "files",
          "staticFallbackAssetId"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    ]
  },
  "invocation": "Builder: await session.execute(tool,input,destination)。input 遵循本卡完整 Schema；destination 原样使用当前 observe/createScope 的目标；只以 committed receipt 判定成功。",
  "name": "component.insert",
  "recovery": "invalid-input: 按本卡 Schema 修正字段；revision-conflict: 重新 observe 后复制新 target 和源码基线；tool-failed: 读取 diagnostics 修复所指输入/资源/宿主条件，失败不代表已提交。",
  "support": "conditional-on-input-target-resources-and-host",
  "supportedScopes": [
    "slide:scene",
    "slide:global",
    "flow:surface",
    "flow:global",
    "spatial-2d:world"
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "carriers": [
        "existing-component"
      ],
      "operation": "existing",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:scene",
        "slide:global",
        "flow:surface",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:world"
      ]
    },
    {
      "carriers": [
        "existing-component"
      ],
      "operation": "catalog",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:scene",
        "slide:global",
        "flow:surface",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:world"
      ]
    },
    {
      "carriers": [
        "generated-component"
      ],
      "operation": "candidate",
      "scopes": [
        "slide:scene",
        "slide:global",
        "flow:surface",
        "flow:global",
        "spatial-2d:world"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "version": 1
}
